    "html": "<p>A flat coil of wire rotates at a constant frequency in a uniform magnetic field, producing an alternating electromotive force (emf) with a peak value <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>. The magnetic field strength is doubled and the period of rotation of the coil is reduced by half. What is the new peak value of the induced emf?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2V\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4V\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8V\"></span></p></li></ol>"
